<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39249" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prŭīna</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		for provina; root pra-, prae; cf. Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωΐ</span>, early, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>hoar-frost</i>, <i>rime</i>
			(cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">glacies, gelu),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 2, 10, 26</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 4, 3 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 60, 61, § 152</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Lucr. 2,
			431</span></i> et saep.—In plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pruinae ac nives,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Cat. 2, 10, 23</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 1, 4, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">matutinae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					3, 488</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Val.
				Fl. 2, 287 al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Snow</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in
			post-class. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nix concreta pruinā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					3, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gelidae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 263</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">3, 368</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Fl. 8,
				210</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Gell. 12, 5,
			11</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			Ad medias sementem extende pruinas, <i>winter</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Verg.
				G. 1, 230</span></i>.</div>
